    'reason.medical': 'The condition they were traveling to get treated has taken a turn.',
    'c0.label': '[{crew}] Treat them',
    'c0.result': '{crew} works through the night with a lamp and a case of instruments and doesn\'t leave the bunk. By morning {first} is sitting up, pale, asking for coffee in a cracked voice. {crew} is asleep in the corridor with a blanket over their shoulders, and nobody steps over them.',
